---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> September 13, 2026</p>

    <p>
      This Cookie Policy explains how Eddies Games uses cookies, browser
      storage, and similar technologies when you visit eddiesgames.xyz or
      play its browser games.
    </p>

    <h2>What are cookies and similar technologies?</h2>

    <p>
      Cookies are small text files stored by your browser. Similar
      technologies include local storage, pixels, tags, and identifiers that
      allow a website or service provider to remember information or
      understand how a service is being used.
    </p>

    <h2>Browser storage used by our games</h2>

    <p>
      Some games may use local browser storage to remember information such
      as:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Game progress</li>
      <li>Daily-game completion status</li>
      <li>Local high scores</li>
      <li>Difficulty or gameplay preferences</li>
      <li>Sound and display preferences</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      This information generally remains on your device and can be removed by
      clearing site data for eddiesgames.xyz in your browser. Clearing it may
      reset saved progress or preferences.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent-management storage</h2>

    <p>
      Google’s certified Consent Management Platform may store your privacy
      choices so that the site can remember whether you consented, declined,
      or selected individual options. This prevents the same message from
      appearing on every page visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising cookies</h2>

    <p>
      Eddies Games uses Google AdSense to display and measure advertising.
      Google and other advertising vendors may use cookies or similar
      technologies to:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Deliver and display advertisements</li>
      <li>Limit how often an advertisement is shown</li>
      <li>Measure advertising performance</li>
      <li>Detect fraud and invalid traffic</li>
      <li>Show personalized advertising where permitted and consented to</li>
      <li>Show non-personalized or limited advertising where appropriate</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads
      based on a visitor’s previous visits to this website or other websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Your consent choices</h2>

    <p>
      Visitors in applicable regions are shown a privacy message that
      provides options to consent, decline consent, or manage individual
      purposes and advertising partners.
    </p>

    <p>
      You may also manage personalized advertising through
      <a
        href="https://adssettings.google.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Google Ads Settings
      </a>
      or opt out of some participating third-party vendors through
      <a
        href="https://optout.aboutads.info/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        YourAdChoices
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Browser controls</h2>

    <p>
      Most browsers allow you to view, block, or delete cookies and local
      site data. Blocking or deleting storage may affect saved progress,
      preferences, leaderboards, consent choices, or other game features.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

    <p>
      We may update this Cookie Policy when our games, advertising services,
      or storage practices change. The revised effective date will appear at
      the top of this page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      For questions about this policy, email
      <a href="mailto:eddie@eddiesgames.xyz">
        eddie@eddiesgames.xyz
      </a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-page h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-page p,
  .legal-page li {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--ember);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-page ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
  }
</style>
